Release 1.7.54 integrates the independently implemented integer-grid
quadrification, CPU/CUDA solver, native mesh reader, and portable build/test
tooling. Operation-local geometry and CPU workspace reuse preserve the
recorded solve inputs and decisions. Validation scope and remaining limits
are documented in docs/VALIDATION.md and docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md.
The symmetry adaptation retains the UniV authors' notices; see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and uv_constraint_kit/symmetry.py.
